  "content": "<p>在使用本模组前，请先观看教程视频。您只能通过浏览器配置本模组（分配按键绑定除外）。这是Minecraft模组开发中一种非传统的方式，如果不看视频，您可能会感到困惑。简而言之，您需要在浏览器中打开 http://localhost:5005/ 来访问模组设置（在游戏加载模组并运行的情况下）。</p><p>本模组仅适用于客户端。</p><p>由于CurseForge严格的自动化Jar文件检查，本模组提供两个版本：带有 <code>-cf</code> 后缀的版本和不带后缀的版本。<code>-cf</code> 版本是经过CurseForge批准的构建，有一些限制（例如，禁用了 <code>os.exec</code> API方法）。如果您想要没有这些限制的完整版本，可以从GitHub下载。</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YrLeLA9.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>观看视频了解模组的实际效果。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9dA_siJT2U8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9dA_siJT2U8\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></a></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zb_sFlW4DL0\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1niobYfF_68\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/oM0kCHeEADM\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/T-zWixIGqIM\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LEQ27z6Akus\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/yXHRLlP7gtc\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2IkLDRInTOc\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></p><p>世界下载：<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uyBNwlWk6fI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uyBNwlWk6fI</a></p><p>拍卖自动化：<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTfyy0-DHfg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTfyy0-DHfg</a></p><p>基岩破坏器：<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cZJAPMoI0dU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cZJAPMoI0dU</a></p>",
